      Geography:
      <fcel/>
      Based on the geographical location of the market area we are targeting area that has two seasons (rainy and dry season). So we have to make products that are in accordance with these geographical conditions.
      <nl/>
      <fcel/>
      Behavioral:
      <fcel/>
      Consumers who are loyal to a particular brand are more likely to try new products than those who are.
      <nl/>
      <fcel/>
      Psychographic:
      <fcel/>
      Their lifestyle tends to be relaxed and reserved, but they care about sustainability.
